[[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the upper bolt (1a) and the lower bolt (1b) and remove the rear seat belt (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/1230.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Position the rear seat belt and tighten the upper and lower fixing bolts to torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the rear seat belt is being replaced, use new fixing bolts.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/774.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Value - daNm</p></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>(lower on bodyshell) 4</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CENTRE REAR SEAT BELT</p></td><td><p>7/16&quot;</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/774.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Value - daNm</p></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CENTRE REAR SEAT BELT</p></td><td><p>7/16&quot;</p></td></tr></table></div>"]]